Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 03:36:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] fix: journey credential shows the day it is recorded, not
 2026-12-20

The shared data's cred-002 has issuedOn 2026-12-20, so the credential card
showed a future date while YoCV says it was recorded in November 2026.
With journey=demo (the iframe now gets it from the host page) the card
shows today's date, formatted like the rest of SkillLens ("28 Nov 2026"),
before and after cred-002 is recorded. The shared JSON is unchanged, and
outside the journey the card still shows the shared date.

- lib/journey.ts: credentialDate(); tests in lib/journey.test.ts

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YcQNX4S5GbGG8rboP8226e
